  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PHJV-ALLAN/DANA HILLS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this project is to conserve critical uplands and wetlands within the Allan/Dana Hills Landscape of the Canadian Prairie Pothole Region to provide long-term benefits to species impacted by the BP Oil Spill. This project will secure approximately 2,641 habitat acres and enhance approximately 1,376 habitat acres.</narrative>
  </description>
